/*
  CostBreakdownWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0031 · CostBreakdownWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `CostBreakdownWidget` resolves (table "CostBreakdownWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first block is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/CostBreakdownWidget.tsx + registry/analytics.ts). Where the web
  value used an `{{interpolation}}` token, the native value uses the matching printf token
  (`%@`) so `String(format:)` renders identical text. The remaining keys back the
  native-only chrome (freshness chip, retry/empty/error copy, accessibility).
*/

